# Unicode Text Examples

Unicode characters can be used to create different text styles in supported apps and websites.

## Try a font tool

Use [Online Fonts Generator](https://onlinefontsgenerator.com/) to explore copy-and-paste text styles.

## CSS font styling

```css
.styled-text {
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-style: italic;
}
```

CSS changes how text looks on a web page. Unicode styled text uses different characters, which may look different across devices.
